    intro: "Even a child makes himself known by his acts, by whether his conduct is pure and upright. Lying lips are an abomination to the Lord, but those who act faithfully are his delight. The soul of the sluggard craves and gets nothing, while the soul of the diligent is richly supplied. The Bible is deeply concerned with character, and parents have the privilege of helping children develop it from the earliest years.",
