    summary: "Learning matters to God. This lesson studies Proverbs 1:7, Proverbs 2:1-6, Luke 2:46-52, Daniel 1:3-5 and 17 and 2 Timothy 3:14-17 to see the value of education, the primary responsibility of parents, partnership with teachers, helping children with different abilities, and the priority of wisdom over mere knowledge.",
    scripture: ["Proverbs 1:7-9", "Proverbs 2:1-6"], more: ["Luke 2:46-52", "Daniel 1:3-5", "2 Timothy 3:14-17"], memory: "Proverbs 1:7",
