    sa: ["How can parents support children's education and wisdom?", ["fear of the lord", "learning", "partner", "teachers", "support", "wisdom"], "A good answer says wisdom begins with the fear of the Lord, parents partner with teachers, help with homework, value each child's abilities and support those who struggle."],
