    summary: "Influences multiply as children grow. This lesson studies Proverbs 13:20, 1 Corinthians 15:33, Psalm 1:1-3, Daniel 1 and Romans 12:2 to see how friends and surroundings shape character, how to help children choose good friends, how to guard against harmful influences without isolating them, and how to encourage them to be a good influence themselves.",
    scripture: ["Proverbs 13:20", "Psalm 1:1-3"], more: ["1 Corinthians 15:33", "Daniel 1:8-16", "Romans 12:2"], memory: "Proverbs 13:20",
